{"id": "3238860", "revid": "119536", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3238860", "title": "Wimbledon 2025 \u2013 Dublu mixt", "text": "Wimbledon 2025 \u2013 Dublu mixt a avut loc \u00een prima jum\u0103tate a lunii iulie 2025. Treizeci \u0219i dou\u0103 de perechi de juc\u0103tori s-au \u00eenscris \u00een competi\u021bia de dublu mixt a turneului englez de Grand Slam disputat la All England Lawn Tennis and Croquet Club. Jan Zieli\u0144ski \u0219i Hsieh Su-wei au fost campionii \u00een exerci\u021biu, dar au pierdut \u00een sferturile de final\u0103 \u00een fa\u021ba perechii Joe Salisbury \u0219i Luisa Stefani.\nSem Verbeek \u0219i Kate\u0159ina Siniakov\u00e1 i-au \u00eenvins pe Joe Salisbury \u0219i Luisa Stefani \u00een final\u0103, cu 7\u20136(7\u20133), 7\u20136(7\u20133), c\u00e2\u0219tig\u00e2nd titlul la dublu mixt la Campionatele de la Wimbledon din 2025.\nTabloul principal.\nFaza final\u0103.\n&lt;section begin=\"mixt\" /&gt;\n&lt;section end=\"mixt\" /&gt;"}
