{"id": "3239715", "revid": "95188", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3239715", "title": "Harold Perrineau", "text": "Harold Perrineau () un actor american. Rolul care i-a adus recunoa\u0219tere a fost \u00een filmul independent \"Fum de \u021bigar\u0103\" (1995), pentru care a fost nominalizat la premiul Independent Spirit pentru cel mai bun actor \u00een rol secundar masculin. A continuat s\u0103 apar\u0103 ca Mercutio \u00een \"Romeo \u0219i Julieta\" (1996) \u0219i ca Link \u00een \"Matrix - Re\u00eenc\u0103rcat\" \u0219i \"Matrix - Revolu\u021bii\" (ambele din 2003). La televiziune, a jucat ca Augustus Hill \u00een drama HBO despre \u00eenchisoare \"Oz\" (1997\u20132003), ca Michael Dawson \u00een serialul ABC \"\" (2004\u20132010) \u0219i ca \u0219eriful Boyd Stevens \u00een serialul horror \"Din\" de la MGM+ (2022\u2013prezent).\nPerrineau a ap\u0103rut \u0219i \u00een filmele \"\u00cenfruntarea\" (1997), \"The Best Man\" (1999), \"Woman on Top\" (2000) \u0219i \"Dup\u0103 28 de s\u0103pt\u0103m\u00e2ni\" (2007). Printre celelalte filme ale sale de televiziune se num\u0103r\u0103 \"Sons of Anarchy\" (2012), \"Constantine\" (2014\u20132015), \"Claws\" (2017\u20132022) \u0219i \"The Recrutul\" (2019\u20132021)."}
